    "name": "WILDERLOCKE",
    "steam_appid": 3512280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WILDERLOCKE</strong> takes the high stakes tactical battles of monster-taming JRPG challenges like the <strong>Nuzlocke</strong> and adds the unpredictability and <strong>replayability of the roguelike formula</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/f8f71a327defdceb211fed70fadba0bf.avif?t=1752283330\" width=628 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.poster.avif?t=1752283330\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.gif?t=1752283330\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ monsters</strong> to discover and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250+ varied moves</strong>, <strong>80+ versatile passives</strong> (and more to come).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customisable set of <strong>4 moves</strong> and <strong>2 passives</strong> for each monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Half of your monster\u2019s stats</strong> depend on its species, <strong>the others are set by you</strong> - build the same monster as a supporting tank or fast damage dealer, depending on what your party needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/2a2fa3f0afa10ed68d394a94898d13ff.avif?t=1752283330\" width=628 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.poster.avif?t=1752283330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.webm?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.mp4?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on <strong>the iconic JRPG battle system</strong>, with a focus on 2v2 mechanics, building synergies and versatile abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your opponents with <strong>a variety of strategies</strong> - protect and strenghten one monster, apply crippling status effects, stall and do damage over time, or simply hit harder and faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to <strong>field conditions</strong> like the weather, or set them yourself to advantage your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No randomness</strong> in battle (no critical hits, chances to miss, or moves with random secondary effects).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Errors are costly</strong> - lose a monster during a battle and it\u2019s lost forever - lose all of them and your run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c0e63ed81b6d1d4e142e1186059201f7.avif?t=1752283330\" width=628 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.poster.avif?t=1752283330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.webm?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.mp4?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique combination </strong>of opponents, encounters &amp; monsters each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12+ different bosses</strong> with <strong>48+ handpicked parties</strong> &amp; unique <strong>battle modifiers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win runs with your favourite monsters to <strong>unlock them as starters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ levels of increasing difficulty</strong>, to challenge even the most experienced monster trainers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free Demo</strong> of the game will be coming soon. <strong>Add WILDERLOCKE to your wishlists</strong> to be notified of its release !</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WILDERLOCKE</strong> takes the high stakes tactical battles of monster-taming JRPG challenges like the <strong>Nuzlocke</strong> and adds the unpredictability and <strong>replayability of the roguelike formula</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/f8f71a327defdceb211fed70fadba0bf.avif?t=1752283330\" width=628 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.poster.avif?t=1752283330\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.gif?t=1752283330\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ monsters</strong> to discover and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250+ varied moves</strong>, <strong>80+ versatile passives</strong> (and more to come).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customisable set of <strong>4 moves</strong> and <strong>2 passives</strong> for each monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Half of your monster\u2019s stats</strong> depend on its species, <strong>the others are set by you</strong> - build the same monster as a supporting tank or fast damage dealer, depending on what your party needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/2a2fa3f0afa10ed68d394a94898d13ff.avif?t=1752283330\" width=628 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.poster.avif?t=1752283330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.webm?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.mp4?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on <strong>the iconic JRPG battle system</strong>, with a focus on 2v2 mechanics, building synergies and versatile abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your opponents with <strong>a variety of strategies</strong> - protect and strenghten one monster, apply crippling status effects, stall and do damage over time, or simply hit harder and faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to <strong>field conditions</strong> like the weather, or set them yourself to advantage your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No randomness</strong> in battle (no critical hits, chances to miss, or moves with random secondary effects).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Errors are costly</strong> - lose a monster during a battle and it\u2019s lost forever - lose all of them and your run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c0e63ed81b6d1d4e142e1186059201f7.avif?t=1752283330\" width=628 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.poster.avif?t=1752283330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.webm?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.mp4?t=1752283330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique combination </strong>of opponents, encounters &amp; monsters each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12+ different bosses</strong> with <strong>48+ handpicked parties</strong> &amp; unique <strong>battle modifiers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win runs with your favourite monsters to <strong>unlock them as starters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ levels of increasing difficulty</strong>, to challenge even the most experienced monster trainers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free Demo</strong> of the game will be coming soon. <strong>Add WILDERLOCKE to your wishlists</strong> to be notified of its release !</p>",
    "short_description": "WILDERLOCKE is a tactical monster-taming roguelike. Build up a team of diverse &amp; powerful monsters. Find the perfect combinations of moves, passives &amp; stats to create devastating synergies. Triumph in increasingly challenging 2v2 turn-based battles and become unstoppable.",
